sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant ModelServer as Model Server Pods<br/>(vLLM / SGLang)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>9090/9091 TCP<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant WVA as WVA Controller<br/>(Saturation Engine)
    participant Analyzers as Analyzer Pipeline<br/>(V2 / Queueing / Throughput)
    participant Optimizer as Optimizer<br/>(CostAware / GreedyByScore)
    participant Enforcer as Enforcer<br/>(Limiter + Actuator)
    participant MetricsEP as WVA /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HPA as HPA / KEDA
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS mTLS
    participant EPP as EPP Pods<br/>(Endpoint Picker)
    participant SFZ as Scale-From-Zero<br/>Engine (100ms)
    participant Coord as Coordinator<br/>(Leader-Elected)

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over ModelServer,MetricsEP: Flow 1: Saturation-Based Autoscaling Decision

        ModelServer->>Prometheus: Expose KV cache, queue,<br/>request rate metrics<br/>HTTP 9090/TCP
        WVA->>Prometheus: PromQL queries<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (SA)
        Prometheus-->>WVA: Replica metrics<br/>(KV cache %, queue depth,<br/>TTFT, ITL, gen token rate)
        WVA->>Analyzers: Collected ReplicaMetrics
        Analyzers->>Analyzers: V2: Token/capacity model<br/>QM: M/M/1 + Kalman filter<br/>Throughput: ITL modeling
        Analyzers-->>Optimizer: VariantCapacity<br/>(PerReplicaCapacity)
        Optimizer->>Optimizer: Compute optimal replicas<br/>per variant (GPU-aware)
        Optimizer-->>Enforcer: Scaling decisions
        Enforcer->>Enforcer: Apply GPU limiter<br/>(inventory or quota)
        Enforcer->>MetricsEP: Emit wva_desired_replicas<br/>+ 25 custom metrics
        HPA->>Prometheus: Read wva_desired_replicas<br/>(external metric)
        HPA->>K8sAPI: Patch scale subresource<br/>HTTPS mTLS<br/>Auth: SA Token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over EPP,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Scale-From-Zero

        SFZ->>EPP: Scrape /metrics (100ms poll)<br/>HTTP<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>(epp-metrics-token)
        EPP-->>SFZ: Queue size &<br/>scheduler metrics
        Note over SFZ: Detect idle model<br/>with pending requests
        SFZ->>K8sAPI: Patch scale target 0→1<br/>HTTPS mTLS<br/>Auth: SA Token
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over Coord,K8sAPI: Flow 3: GPU Quota Rebalancing (Coordinator)

        Coord->>K8sAPI: List ResourceQuotas<br/>HTTPS mTLS
        K8sAPI-->>Coord: Per-namespace GPU quotas
        Coord->>Prometheus: Query EPP queue depths<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Prometheus-->>Coord: Queue depth per pool
        Note over Coord: gpu-rebalance plugin:<br/>Redistribute GPU quota<br/>proportional to queue depth
        Coord->>K8sAPI: Patch HPA maxReplicas /<br/>ScaledObject maxReplicaCount<br/>HTTPS mTLS
    end
